%% Diagramme de Gantt - Planning previsionnel 6 semaines (CDC §12.2)
gantt
    title Planning du projet - Plateforme patrimoine (6 semaines)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d/%m

    section Pilotage & cadrage
    Analyse du besoin et cadrage           :a1, 2026-11-16, 5d
    Conception UML et architecture         :a2, after a1, 7d
    Design UI/UX Figma                     :a3, after a1, 7d

    section Socle technique
    Docker, CI/CD, API Gateway, Auth       :b1, after a1, 14d

    section Services metier
    Organisation et referentiels           :c1, after b1, 7d
    Patrimoine (biens)                     :c2, after b1, 14d
    Mouvements et affectations             :c3, after b1, 10d
    Inventaire et recolement               :c4, after c2, 10d
    Maintenance                            :c5, after c2, 7d
    Valorisation et amortissement          :c6, after c2, 10d

    section Services transverses
    Documents (GED)                        :d1, after c2, 6d
    Notifications et audit                 :d2, after c3, 8d
    Reporting et tableaux de bord          :d3, after d2, 10d

    section Interface web
    Integration progressive des ecrans     :e1, after c1, 21d

    section Qualite & recette
    Tests, corrections, recette UAT         :f1, 2026-12-14, 14d
    Documentation, formation, deploiement  :f2, after f1, 7d

    section Jalons
    J1 Validation CDC                      :milestone, m1, after a1, 0d
    J2 Validation UML + maquettes          :milestone, m2, after b1, 0d
    J3 Demo socle + premiers services      :milestone, m3, after c2, 0d
    J4 Gel perimetre + debut recette       :milestone, m4, after c6, 0d
    J5 Mise en production + reception      :milestone, m5, after f2, 0d
